# fresh_dev_paused_nub_cursor_show_dies: While the host has the device paused, the guest restarts the root     FIFO (0x1000 = 0, then 1): pause drained the old one and paused the     guest displays, but the new FIFO runs, its NOP's stamp lands (0x1018)     with no interrupt (run state 5). CursorShow (5), GuestDisplay::cursor_show, then reaches the paused guest     display, whose first check, that it is not paused, ends the process     (its CommandWhilePaused death): the host dies in the wait after the     doorbell.
